{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.bvCheck\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">bvCheck</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"This tactic works just like `bv_decide` but skips calling a SAT solver by using a proof that is\nalready stored on disk. It is called with the name of an LRAT file in the same directory as the\ncurrent Lean file:\n```\nbv_check \"proof.lrat\"\n```\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.bvCheck","kind":"def","line":400,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.bvCheck","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L400-L401"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.bvTrace\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">bvTrace</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Suggest a proof script for a `bv_decide` tactic call. Useful for caching LRAT proofs.\n\nNote: include `import Std.Tactic.BVDecide`\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.bvTrace","kind":"def","line":397,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.bvTrace","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L397-L398"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.bvDecide\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">bvDecide</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Close fixed-width `BitVec` and `Bool` goals by obtaining a proof from an external SAT solver and\nverifying it inside Lean. The solvable goals are currently limited to\n- the Lean equivalent of [`QF_BV`](https://smt-lib.org/logics-all.shtml#QF_BV)\n- automatically splitting up `structure`s that contain information about `BitVec` or `Bool`\n```lean\nexample : ∀ (a b : BitVec 64), (a &&& b) + (a ^^^ b) = a ||| b := by\n  intros\n  bv_decide\n```\n\nIf `bv_decide` encounters an unknown definition it will be treated like an unconstrained `BitVec`\nvariable. Sometimes this enables solving goals despite not understanding the definition because\nthe precise properties of the definition do not matter in the specific proof.\n\nIf `bv_decide` fails to close a goal it provides a counter-example, containing assignments for all\nterms that were considered as variables.\n\nIn order to avoid calling a SAT solver every time, the proof can be cached with `bv_decide?`.\n\nIf solving your problem relies inherently on using associativity or commutativity, consider enabling\nthe `bv.ac_nf` option.\n\n`bv_decide types [T₁, ..., Tₙ]` restricts the analysis of structures and enum inductives to\n`T₁, ..., Tₙ`, treating all other ones as opaque variables.\n\nNote: `bv_decide` trusts the correctness of the code generator and adds a axioms asserting its result.\n\nNote: include `import Std.Tactic.BVDecide`\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.bvDecide","kind":"def","line":394,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.bvDecide","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L394-L395"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.bvNormalize\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">bvNormalize</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Run the normalization procedure of `bv_decide` only. Sometimes this is enough to solve basic\n`BitVec` goals already.\n\nNote: include `import Std.Tactic.BVDecide`\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.bvNormalize","kind":"def","line":391,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.bvNormalize","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L391-L392"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symCbv\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">symCbv</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`cbv` performs simplification that closely mimics call-by-value evaluation.\nIt reduces terms by unfolding definitions using their defining equations and\napplying matcher equations. The unfolding is propositional, so `cbv` also works\nwith functions defined via well-founded recursion or partial fixpoints.\n\n`cbv` reduces the goal target using call-by-value evaluation. For equation goals\n(`lhs = rhs`), `cbv` automatically attempts `refl` after reduction to close the goal.\n\nUnlike the standalone `cbv` tactic, this variant does not support the `at` location\nsyntax: in `sym =>` mode it only reduces the goal target.\n\n`cbv` is not a finishing tactic in general: it may leave a new (simpler) goal.\n\nThe proofs produced by `cbv` only use the three standard axioms.\nIn particular, they do not require trust in the correctness of the code\ngenerator.\n\nThis is a variant of `cbv` that only works in `sym =>` mode.\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symCbv","kind":"def","line":369,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symCbv","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L369-L389"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.grindExact_\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">grindExact_</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`exact e` closes the main goal if its target type matches that of `e`. ","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.grindExact_","kind":"def","line":366,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.grindExact_","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L366-L366"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symRw\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">symRw</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`rw [h₁, ..., hₙ]` rewrites the goal target using the given equations or iffs, left to right.\nUse `← h` to rewrite right to left. Only available in `sym =>` mode, and it only rewrites the\ntarget: in `sym =>` mode hypotheses are never modified.\n\nPremises of a conditional rewrite rule that cannot be resolved by unification or type class\nresolution become new goals.\n\n`rw` is **not** a high-performance tactic: it does not exploit the maximal sharing maintained\nby `sym =>` mode, and should be used for surgical changes to the goal, not for bulk\nsimplification. Use `simp`/`dsimp` variants for that.\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symRw","kind":"def","line":351,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symRw","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L351-L363"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symDSimp\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">symDSimp</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`dsimp` applies the definitional simplifier to the goal target.\nOnly available in `sym =>` mode.\n\n- `dsimp` — uses the default (identity) variant\n- `dsimp myVariant` — uses a named variant registered via `register_sym_dsimp`\n- `dsimp [id₁, id₂, ...]` — default variant with extra declarations to unfold\n- `dsimp myVariant [id₁, id₂, ...]` — named variant with extra declarations\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symDSimp","kind":"def","line":340,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symDSimp","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L340-L349"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symSimp\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">symSimp</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`simp` applies the structural simplifier to the goal target.\nOnly available in `sym =>` mode.\n\n- `simp` — uses the default (identity) variant\n- `simp myVariant` — uses a named variant registered via `register_sym_simp`\n- `simp [thm₁, thm₂, ...]` — default variant with extra rewrite theorems appended to `post`\n- `simp myVariant [thm₁, thm₂, ...]` — named variant with extra theorems\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symSimp","kind":"def","line":329,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symSimp","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L329-L338"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symByContra\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">symByContra</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`by_contra` applies proof by contradiction, negating the target and making it `False`.\nOnly available in `sym =>` mode. ","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symByContra","kind":"def","line":325,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symByContra","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L325-L327"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symInternalizeAll\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">symInternalizeAll</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`internalize_all` internalizes all pending hypotheses into the grind E-graph.\nOnly available in `sym =>` mode. ","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symInternalizeAll","kind":"def","line":321,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symInternalizeAll","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L321-L323"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symInternalize\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">symInternalize</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`internalize` internalizes hypotheses into the grind E-graph.\nOnly available in `sym =>` mode.\n- `internalize` internalizes the next hypothesis.\n- `internalize <num>` internalizes the next `<num>` hypotheses. ","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symInternalize","kind":"def","line":315,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symInternalize","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L315-L319"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symApply\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">symApply</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`apply t` applies theorem `t` as a backward rule.\nOnly available in `sym =>` mode.\nWhen used with `repeat`, the backward rule is cached for efficiency. ","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symApply","kind":"def","line":310,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symApply","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L310-L313"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symIntrosLight\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">symIntrosLight</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`intros~` is shorthand for `intros (internalize := false)`. ","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symIntrosLight","kind":"def","line":304,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symIntrosLight","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L304-L305"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symIntros\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">symIntros</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`intros` introduces all remaining binders and internalizes them.\nOnly available in `sym =>` mode.\nUse `intros (internalize := false)` or `intros~` to skip internalization. ","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symIntros","kind":"def","line":299,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symIntros","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L299-L302"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symIntroLight\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">symIntroLight</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`intro~ x₁ ... xₙ` is shorthand for `intro (internalize := false)`. ","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symIntroLight","kind":"def","line":293,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symIntroLight","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L293-L294"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symIntro\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">symIntro</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`intro x₁ ... xₙ` introduces binders and internalizes them into the E-graph.\nOnly available in `sym =>` mode.\n`intro` with no arguments introduces one binder with an inaccessible name.\nUse `intro (internalize := false)` or `intro~` to skip internalization. ","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symIntro","kind":"def","line":287,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.symIntro","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L287-L291"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.mbtc\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">mbtc</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Adds new case-splits using model-based theory combination.\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.mbtc","kind":"def","line":282,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.mbtc","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L282-L285"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.haveSilent\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">haveSilent</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Proves `<term>` using the current `grind` state and default search strategy.\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.haveSilent","kind":"def","line":277,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.haveSilent","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L277-L280"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.setConfig\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">setConfig</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`set_config configItem+ in tacs` executes `tacs` with the updated configuration options `configItem+`\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.setConfig","kind":"def","line":272,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.setConfig","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L272-L275"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.setOption\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">setOption</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`set_option opt val in tacs` (the tactic) acts like `set_option opt val` at the command level,\nbut it sets the option only within the tactics `tacs`. ","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.setOption","kind":"def","line":267,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.setOption","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L267-L270"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.exposeNames\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">exposeNames</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`expose_names` renames all inaccessible variables with accessible names, making them available\nfor reference in generated tactics. However, this renaming introduces machine-generated names\nthat are not fully under user control. `expose_names` is primarily intended as a preamble for\ngenerated `grind` tactic scripts.\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.exposeNames","kind":"def","line":259,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.exposeNames","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L259-L265"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.renameI\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">renameI</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`rename_i x_1 ... x_n` renames the last `n` inaccessible names using the given names. ","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.renameI","kind":"def","line":256,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.renameI","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L256-L257"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.grindRepeat_\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">grindRepeat_</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`repeat tac` repeatedly applies `tac` so long as it succeeds.\nThe tactic `tac` may be a tactic sequence, and if `tac` fails at any point in its execution,\n`repeat` will revert any partial changes that `tac` made to the tactic state.\nThe tactic `tac` should eventually fail, otherwise `repeat tac` will run indefinitely.\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.grindRepeat_","kind":"def","line":245,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.grindRepeat_","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L245-L251"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.fail\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">fail</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`fail msg` is a tactic that always fails, and produces an error using the given message. ","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.fail","kind":"def","line":242,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.fail","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L242-L243"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.grindAdmit\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">grindAdmit</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`admit` is a synonym for `sorry`. ","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.grindAdmit","kind":"def","line":240,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.grindAdmit","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L240-L240"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.failIfSuccess\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">failIfSuccess</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`fail_if_success t` fails if the tactic `t` succeeds. ","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.failIfSuccess","kind":"def","line":236,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.failIfSuccess","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L236-L237"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.grindTry_\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">grindTry_</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`try tac` runs `tac` and succeeds even if `tac` failed. ","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.grindTry_","kind":"def","line":234,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.grindTry_","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L234-L234"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.first\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">first</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`first (tac) ...` runs each `tac` until one succeeds, or else fails. ","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.first","kind":"def","line":230,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.first","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L230-L231"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.«grind_&lt;;&gt;_»\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">«grind_&lt;;&gt;_»</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.TrailingParserDescr\">TrailingParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`tac <;> tac'` runs `tac` on the main goal and `tac'` on each produced goal,\nconcatenating all goals produced by `tac'`.\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.«grind_<;>_»","kind":"def","line":224,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.«grind_<;>_»","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L224-L228"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.withAnnotateState\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">withAnnotateState</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`with_annotate_state stx t` annotates the lexical range of `stx : Syntax` with\nthe initial and final state of running tactic `t`.\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.withAnnotateState","kind":"def","line":213,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.withAnnotateState","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L213-L218"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.anyGoals\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">anyGoals</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`any_goals tac` applies the tactic `tac` to every goal,\nconcatenating the resulting goals for successful tactic applications.\nIf the tactic fails on all of the goals, the entire `any_goals` tactic fails.\n\nThis tactic is like `all_goals try tac` except that it fails if none of the applications of `tac` succeeds.\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.anyGoals","kind":"def","line":204,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.anyGoals","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L204-L211"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.case\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">case</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"* `case tag => tac` focuses on the goal with case name `tag` and solves it using `tac`,\n  or else fails.\n* `case tag x₁ ... xₙ => tac` additionally renames the `n` most recent hypotheses\n  with inaccessible names to the given names.\n* `case tag₁ | tag₂ => tac` is equivalent to `(case tag₁ => tac); (case tag₂ => tac)`.\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.case","kind":"def","line":195,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.case","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L195-L202"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.«grind·_»\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">«grind·_»</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`· grindSeq` focuses on the main `grind` goal and tries to solve it using the given\nsequence of `grind` tactics.\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.«grind·_»","kind":"def","line":193,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.«grind·_»","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L193-L193"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.next\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">next</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`next => tac` focuses on the next goal and solves it using `tac`, or else fails.\n`next x₁ ... xₙ => tac` additionally renames the `n` most recent hypotheses with\ninaccessible names to the given names.\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.next","kind":"def","line":182,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.next","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L182-L187"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.focus\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">focus</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`focus tac` focuses on the main goal, suppressing all other goals, and runs `tac` on it.\nUsually `· tac`, which enforces that the goal is closed by `tac`, should be preferred.\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.focus","kind":"def","line":176,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.focus","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L176-L180"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.allGoals\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">allGoals</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`all_goals tac` runs `tac` on each goal, concatenating the resulting goals.\nIf the tactic fails on any goal, the entire `all_goals` tactic fails.\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.allGoals","kind":"def","line":170,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.allGoals","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L170-L174"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.nestedTacticCore\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">nestedTacticCore</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Executes the given tactic block to close the current goal. ","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.nestedTacticCore","kind":"def","line":167,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.nestedTacticCore","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L167-L168"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.have\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">have</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The `have` tactic is for adding opaque definitions and hypotheses to the local context of the main goal.\nThe definitions forget their associated value and cannot be unfolded.\n\n* `have h : t := e` adds the hypothesis `h : t` if `e` is a term of type `t`.\n* `have h := e` uses the type of `e` for `t`.\n* `have : t := e` and `have := e` use `this` for the name of the hypothesis.\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.have","kind":"def","line":157,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.have","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L157-L165"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.finishTrace\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">finishTrace</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`finish?` tries to close the current goal using `grind`'s default strategy and suggests a tactic script. ","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.finishTrace","kind":"def","line":153,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.finishTrace","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L153-L155"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.finish\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">finish</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`finish` tries to close the current goal using `grind`'s default strategy ","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.finish","kind":"def","line":149,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.finish","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L149-L151"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.done\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">done</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`done` succeeds iff there are no remaining goals. ","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.done","kind":"def","line":146,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.done","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L146-L147"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.casesNext\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">casesNext</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Performs the next case-split. The case-split is selected using the same heuristic used by `finish`.\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.casesNext","kind":"def","line":141,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.casesNext","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L141-L144"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.casesTrace\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">casesTrace</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A variant of `cases` that provides a code-action for selecting one of the candidate case-splits\navailable in the `grind` state.\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.casesTrace","kind":"def","line":135,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.casesTrace","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L135-L139"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.cases\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">cases</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Performs a case-split on a logical connective, `match`-expression, `if-then-else`-expression,\nor inductive predicate. The argument is an anchor referencing one of the case-split candidates\nin the `grind` state. You can use `cases?` to select a specific candidate using a code action.\nIf multiple candidates match the anchor (e.g., they differ only in inaccessible variables),\nan ordinal reference such as `#a56e/2` selects the second matching candidate.\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.cases","kind":"def","line":126,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.cases","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L126-L133"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.grind_ref__1\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">grind_ref__1</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.grind_ref__1","kind":"def","line":124,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.grind_ref__1","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L124-L124"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.«grind_ref__/__»\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">«grind_ref__/__»</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Anchor with an ordinal disambiguator. Distinct case-split candidates may have the same anchor.\nFor example, two candidates that differ only in inaccessible variables have identical anchors.\n`#a56e/2` refers to the second candidate (in the case-split candidate list) matching the anchor `#a56e`.\n","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.«grind_ref__/__»","kind":"def","line":118,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.«grind_ref__/__»","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L118-L123"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.grind_ref_\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">grind_ref_</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Interactive.html#Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.grind_ref_","kind":"def","line":117,"name":"Lean.Parser.Tactic.Grind.grind_ref_","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Grind/Interactive.lean#L117-L117"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</sp